iginal_sha256":"a354426ac8b5d20553e5a99289a64735658f46bdabd2a3f15be5f9e93f17e9ae","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":142469,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:627b1fba8d7e6fa572258cbc","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/934aeae58b1bcc3343e3fd1517e960162d48e3a9b17d9ff1a27e224d81e3081a.json","sha256":"358799285236a06460dfecb2da6bbcde8efc8e6f2e48a8fd803af42268c67d07"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-103/question_01.png","sha256":"a354426ac8b5d20553e5a99289a64735658f46bdabd2a3f15be5f9e93f17e9ae"}],"text":""},"source:83bed5250293349d4f1a9f3a":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["曲面方程约束"],"metadata":{},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:83bed5250293349d4f1a9f3a","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-494_曲面方程约束.md","sha256":"48ba2ecd4c2ed5162d46a54265fdbeeff87ade5c3360b3a7614a4177e0be8847"}],"text":"# 曲面方程约束\n\n## 定位\n\n本页是按正式错题卡 `knowledge` 标签维护的知识点簇页面，用于把相关正式错题接入 LLM Wiki。它只列轻量元数据，不复制完整题干或长解析。\n\n## 覆盖统计\n\n- 相关错题数：1\n- 涉及科目：高等数学\n- 代表错题：GS-737\n\n## 错题清单\n\n| id | source summary | subject | chapter | error_causes | methods / gap | status | formal card |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n| GS-737 | [[SRC-WQ-GS-737]] | 高等数学 | 多元函数积分学 | 局部侧向与整体内外侧混淆；代数减法与方向符号混淆；法向量与标量正负混淆；积分类型边界混淆；定义型化简未触发；高斯公式内侧负号遗漏 | 曲面方程代入化简；补面法；高斯公式；法向量方向检查；常数乘体积；method_gap:B5-CHECK | 待复做 | `错题知识网络/错题卡/GS-737_102390下半球补面方向.md` |\n\n## 后续编译动作\n\n- 若本标签形成稳定第一动作或反复错因，再升级为深度概念、方法、错因或触发页。\n- 缺少个人作答证据时只保留索引关系，不反推用户错因。\n\n## 入口\n\n- [[SRC-WRONGCARDS-INDEX_全量错题卡覆盖索引]]\n- [[MATHWIKI-COVERAGE-MATRIX_错题卡多维编译矩阵]]"},"source:893b59d00081ae314b8bb02c":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["一元函数微分学应用","参数范围","含参方程转值域","商函数单调性","极限与连续","泰勒公式","零点定理"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-241/question_01.png","original_sha256":"c7257896347669a130bf2113f8165f0683edf19d39a8511e1967f238093f0816","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":30700,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:893b59d00081ae314b8bb02c","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/9a3e04eedf88390d4029f48b2785f4067aa8c3e06c92e757a2ee9a065ccb3021.json","sha256":"cfa17975cdf4eb3789832277b385af14644792f37f1814a23b513288ff894aae"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-241/question_01.png","sha256":"c7257896347669a130bf2113f8165f0683edf19d39a8511e1967f238093f0816"}],"text":""},"source:a6539e4ed6ea0540c4bb910c":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["满行秩、满列秩与消去条件"],"metadata":{},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:a6539e4ed6ea0540c4bb910c","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-567_满行秩、满列秩与消去条件.md","sha256":"5c90a1cd02b5e2bc69f3e87c7c1818c040b74513d670a85b1e8b6e14f0901e9e"}],"text":"# 满行秩、满列秩与消去条件\n\n本页是由五份讲义来源提炼的通用知识锚点，不含本人作答证据；关联题只表示知识点归属，不推断错因、掌握度或复习状态。\n\n## 范围\n\n用满列秩保证左乘不降低秩、满行秩保证右乘不降低秩，并据此消去矩阵因子。\n\n## 条件与边界\n\n矩形矩阵只有单侧性质；不能从AB=AC无条件约掉A，也不能把左逆、右逆混同。\n\n## 来源\n\n| 来源 | 文件 | PDF页 | 书内页 | 定位短语 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ZY-L | 《2026 张宇线性 9讲》.pdf | 51–52 | 41–42 | 列满秩 |\n| L880 | 【A4紧凑版】880数一线概篇做题本.pdf | 22 | 21 | 单位矩阵 |\n\n## 上级知识节点\n\n- 矩阵秩（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n\n## 知识关系（提案，未生效）\n\n- prerequisite → LA04.04：建议的学习／调用前置，不是逻辑充分条件；允许其他学习顺序。\n\n## 关联正式题\n\n暂无关联正式题。\n\n## 来源标识\n\n- 参考包运行标识：`A-math-anchor-distribution-20260909-01`\n- 包内定位：`LA04.02`（仅用于本包定位，不是本地正式 ID）\n- 来源范围：`main`；锚点类型：`knowledge`"},"source:abb813f66f257b0285fb5aba":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"accepted_conversation_excerpt","labels":["叉乘","向量线性表示","法向量","空间平面方程"],"metadata":{"capture_ids":["MFI-CAP-a284312db63a88a285c4c237"],"closeout_id":"MFI-CLOSE-fdaf40392c72edae6ce6898d","conversation_complete":true,"coverage":"full_bytes","files":[{"path":"/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-4fc9cbd546cbbb580cfdf8be/conversation.json","sha256":"f5777c42284bfc52bd78889d446b604d69c313f7afb11840c550265dc138b5d8","status":"verified","text_status":"available"},{"path":"/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-4fc9cbd546cbbb580cfdf8be/source.json","sha256":"a250a783bdccc96b4ed048f8a02fcb743227e4b01f4c221f23d322a7f3fe4bf3","status":"verified","text_status":"available"},{"path":"/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-4fc9cbd546cbbb580cfdf8be/attachments/explanation_image_01.png","sha256":"0d7189cdb221460d266a249aaba7149cd088f4a7b8a1dc7890063f79b05be365","status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},{"path":"/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-4fc9cbd546cbbb580cfdf8be/attachments/explanation_image_02.png","sha256":"fc4495e0ae940532bea1a6736e2dde607e21bd66d6f1edc2ade8ad131d5e8e0e","status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},{"path":"/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-4fc9cbd546cbbb580cfdf8be/attachments/question_image_01.png","sha256":"ab11b9df927bb8b7698702516b4d080db16b8d8fbebae6f417069294aef60a04","status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},{"path":"/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-4fc9cbd546cbbb580cfdf8be/attachments/solution_text_01.md","sha256":"96e458c6152d6d4ed5aad9648bb21c2e50128d582f3426e6c8e3e0c69f8b3a41","status":"verified","text_status":"available"},{"path":"/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-4fc9cbd546cbbb580cfdf8be/attachments/solution_text_02.md","sha256":"9d5e1aaecb038abf64ebe78c9286e1d7368c17c120f132656b0551a8e87b485c","status":"verified","text_status":"available"}],"origi